# The effect slot accepts the bare name in every build and `@status-<name>`
# from v160.x on (LParser normalises a bare known name to that constant), so
# all of these are CORRECT and must produce no finding at all.
ubind @flare
status false unmoving @unit 60
status true @status-wet @unit 0
set s @status-wet
status false s @unit 60
status true wet @unit 0
end
